Third-party dependencies
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The optional on-device web data portal links the WebConsole library
("esp_webserver"), which is licensed under GPLv3. This does not affect the
license of birdoscope's own source (MIT). However, a compiled firmware image
that links WebConsole is a combined work governed by GPLv3: if you distribute
such a binary (a release image or a pre-flashed device), distribute it under
GPLv3 and make the complete corresponding source available. Builds that exclude
the web portal carry no such obligation.
